Error [E1314]: `parts` can only be used in a `loop … in parts` loop here
  --> tests/ui/variadic_bound_body_shape.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(parts.len())
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `parts` is a trait-bounded variadic (`...Trait` / `...[A, B]`) — its elements can have different concrete types, so there's no single Rust type to give `parts` outside a loop that visits each argument once
 Fix: iterate it with `loop x; parts { … }` — that's the only supported use
